{"dpi": 300, "w": 2480, "h": 3507, "rows": [{"t": "(2)", "c": 1, "y": 254.8691865454957, "h": 56.07121942252623, "x": 1110.1437362042407, "w": 76.38603973388673}, {"c": 1, "h": 55.41973664034733, "t": "LJB(H)", "x": 1058.6075845684286, "y": 344.39914281472693, "w": 179.45834350585952}, {"h": 56.632022189985086, "t": "30 Marks", "c": 1, "x": 1848.4828302122494, "w": 264.9234619140626, "y": 422.8024480488026}, {"c": 1, "x": 1017.3434510002826, "y": 439.1655038421043, "h": 57.637488050906484, "w": 271.90063476562506, "t": "PART-1"}, {"w": 427.7618103027344, "h": 66.26598624356645, "x": 942.0944563303576, "y": 565.8095938071632, "c": 1, "t": "(MCQ Portion)"}, {"y": 683.939397679666, "t": "\u2022 Answers to MCOs are to be marked on the OMR answer sheet as given on the cover", "h": 98.40301702014403, "w": 1845.404296875, "c": 1, "x": 167.0522844506463}, {"h": 96.0412217524058, "t": "page of the descriptive answer book only. Answer to MCOs, if written inside the", "c": 1, "x": 228.17262763262306, "y": 786.501616034114, "w": 1784.255126953125}, {"c": 1, "w": 989.854553222656, "x": 238.45685385885702, "t": "descriptive answer book shall not be evaluated.", "y": 906.3422761505484, "h": 80.54684913878867}, {"w": 1845.3836669921875, "t": "\u2022 Please write and darken correct MCQ booklet number in the OMR answer sheet. The", "y": 992.065550494643, "c": 1, "x": 172.08209887982161, "h": 97.48158786560539}, {"w": 1600.8721923828127, "c": 1, "y": 1098.4540315160789, "t": "correct MCQ booklet number must also be written in the attendance register.", "h": 98.07853221349583, "x": 243.3430591595627}, {"y": 1350.6148808263188, "w": 443.03900146484375, "t": "Case Scenario - 1:", "x": 183.32649783431316, "h": 56.26302492931226, "c": 1}, {"w": 1850.8288574218748, "y": 1434.1830087989395, "h": 108.22292506219077, "c": 1, "t": "Shree Foods Private Ltd., engaged in the production and distribution of packaged", "x": 182.35193053620787}, {"t": "snacks. To increase sales, it introduced volume discounts and extended credit", "h": 98.0641854132866, "x": 187.46549202065376, "y": 1548.5766093755199, "c": 1, "w": 1850.5205078125}, {"x": 188.4188893926398, "w": 529.60986328125, "h": 56.17003005342019, "y": 1692.3313955419783, "t": "facilities to distributors.", "c": 1}, {"y": 1775.0002388418056, "h": 109.94803435391971, "w": 1850.8822021484375, "x": 192.4010678194693, "t": "The statutory audit of Shree Foods Private Ltd. was assigned to CA Vivek. While", "c": 1}, {"c": 1, "x": 192.10985340435172, "y": 1885.2815397356826, "w": 1851.126708984375, "t": "planning the audit programme, CA Vivek first obtained an understanding of the", "h": 109.65397834016638}, {"h": 98.49382669759856, "t": "company's internal control system and evaluated whether such controls were", "c": 1, "y": 2005.0875038536365, "x": 197.6854094351163, "w": 1850.3818359375}, {"t": "actually operating effectively. He prepared a detailed audit plan specifying", "x": 197.4166320645461, "c": 1, "h": 111.89959961141953, "w": 1850.8160400390627, "y": 2108.425967235041}, {"y": 2255.002586380872, "x": 197.2906541653782, "t": "procedures such as :", "c": 1, "w": 455.66839599609375, "h": 70.28177842039052}, {"t": "-Testing a sample of 100 invoices out of 1200 revenue transactions.", "y": 2340.1132514102164, "c": 1, "w": 1601.0052490234373, "x": 192.34640769288865, "h": 108.90035183209508}, {"w": 1045.4560546875002, "x": 325.01759614462105, "c": 1, "t": "Reviewing discount approvals and credit notes.", "h": 81.12617460922876, "y": 2478.3050205004743}, {"x": 207.86996342874974, "y": 2595.1577886876953, "c": 1, "w": 1117.1678466796875, "h": 89.64499719656749, "t": "During the audit, the following issues were noted :"}, {"h": 98.46081609084364, "c": 1, "x": 207.65484377505118, "t": "(i) Some invoices with incorrect revenue amounts were not included in the", "w": 1855.6967773437498, "y": 2696.2923083930286}, {"t": "selected sample and hence misstatements remained undetected.", "x": 329.92341679992205, "w": 1392.